        "text": "Petitioner argues that the Hague Service Convention permits service of process by mail when the destination state does not object and presents a three\u2011part argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "db154d196f142a5c0c1949fe9c8194009f74b5ee42aac6dd2caa15405b4e3775",
